 "notes": "New shelf (no old kinds). Award bodies recorded: Academy of Chocolate Awards (London, since 2005; Golden Bean top bar award) https://academyofchocolate.org.uk/about-the-awards/ and International Chocolate Awards (since 2012, run by IICCT; regional rounds and a World Final; bean-to-bar categories) https://www.internationalchocolateawards.com/about-us. Left out because no page could be retrieved (cocoarunners/chocosphere 403, chocolats-de-luxe 503): Bonnat, Original Beans (brands and bars), Madagascar Sambirano, Peru and Ghana as origin archetypes, Valrhona Manjari/Caraïbe/Dulcey, Lindt Excellence launch year and percentages, Freia Melkesjokolade launch year, Côte d'Or bars. Pump Street, Mast Brothers kept as brands with bars only in m. Countlines (Kit Kat, Mars) belong to the Pralines/confections shelf. Brand entries added later from reliable knowledge (s=knowledge, owner decision): Daniel Peter, Kohler, Bonnat, Original Beans, Côte d'Or, Freia."
